## Model card

- **Name:** MAI-Code-1-Flash
- **Short description:** Microsoft’s MAI-Code-1-Flash is described as a Copilot-native agentic coding model (5B active, 256K context) positioned for efficient software engineering tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Microsoft AI / GitHub Copilot contexts per metadata. Local metadata lists `microsoft/mai-code-1-flash`, pricing $0.75/$4.50 per 1M, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Models.dev listing and local metadata reviewed 2026-11-10. Official Microsoft announcement URL in metadata returned 404 in this pass. Knowledge cutoff listed as 2025-12 on models.dev.
- **IDs:** `mai-code-1-flash`, `MAI-Code-1-Flash`.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens total; 128,000 max output (models.dev/metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.75/$4.50 per 1M in/out (GitHub Copilot/models.dev per metadata); no first-party Microsoft price card published.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary closed model (5B active per metadata). Architecture details not publicly disclosed in accessible sources.

